Preconditions:
Valid JWT for employee E1; Annual balance 20
Headers: {
  "Authorization": "Bearer <E1_JWT>",
  "Content-Type": "application/json"
}

Steps:
POST /api/v1/leaves
Body: {
  "type": "ANNUAL",
  "startDate": "<today+7>",
  "endDate": "<today+9>",
  "reason": "Family trip"
}
1. Send request
2. Validate status and schema
3. GET /api/v1/leaves/{leaveId}

Preconditions:
L-100 Pending, owned by E1; caller M1 (E1's manager)
Headers: {
  "Authorization": "Bearer <M1_JWT>",
  "Content-Type": "application/json"
}

L-104 Pending (any employee); caller HR Admin
Headers: {
  "Authorization": "Bearer <HR_JWT>",
  "Content-Type": "application/json"
}

E2 owns L-201; caller is E1 (Employee)
Headers: {
  "Authorization": "Bearer <E1_JWT>"
}

Caller is Employee E2; L-100 Pending
Headers: {
  "Authorization": "Bearer <E2_JWT>",
  "Content-Type": "application/json"
}

L-200 owned by E9 (reports to M2); caller M1
Headers: {
  "Authorization": "Bearer <M1_JWT>",
  "Content-Type": "application/json"
}

Expired JWT; JWT with modified payload/signature
Headers: {
  "Authorization": "Bearer <EXPIRED_OR_TAMPERED_JWT>",
  "Content-Type": "application/json"
}

L-100 already APPROVED; caller M1
Headers: {
  "Authorization": "Bearer <M1_JWT>",
  "Content-Type": "application/json"
}

Steps:
PATCH /api/v1/leaves/{id}/status
Body: {
  "status": "REJECTED",
  "comment": "Changed my mind now"
}
1. Send PATCH
